- How would you test the rollback playbook in CI/CD?
- What telemetry confirms containment success?

## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical implementation of multi-tenant isolation in analytics environments, specifically testing knowledge of data-layer controls, IAM scoping, performance optimization, and automated validation mechanisms. It demonstrates understanding of defense-in-depth principles in shared cloud resources.

## Key Concepts

- BigQuery isolation patterns: per-tenant datasets vs. Row-Level Security
- Authorized views and security policy implementation
- IAM role-based access controls with least privilege
- CI/CD validation using synthetic tenant simulation
- Performance optimization with per-tenant BI Engine reservations

## Code Example

```javascript
